  "prompt": "Which of store BE-14's orders of 2024 had a line resent, and what is each one's value once the copies are removed? These tables may hold errors. Some of store BE-14's order lines were resent under a new order_line_id: two lines are copies of one order line when order_id, product_id, quantity and unit_price_eur all match. Keep the copy with the lowest order_line_id. A line's value is quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur. 2024 means order_ts, as stored, from 1 January 2024 up to but not including 1 January 2025. Return two columns, in this order: order_id and order_value. Return one row for each BE-14 order of 2024 with at least one resent line. Any row order is fine.",
